# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `tests/run.sh --asan`.
# The compiler (build/hphp_asan) is a short-lived batch process that keeps its
# AST and output buffers until exit by design. Its leaks would bury the ones
# that matter: leaks in the compiled test programs, which are a separate
# module and are still reported.
leak:hphp_asan
